# UI Guidelines
1. Touch Targets: All interactive elements must meet WCAG 2.1 AA minimum touch target size of 44x44pt.
2. Accessibility: Ensure support for VoiceOver on iOS and TalkBack on Android, and provide descriptive alt text for all pet animations.
3. Color Usage: Color is never the sole indicator of meaning. Pet state labels must appear as text beneath the sprite.
4. State Transitions: Transitions between pet visual states must use smooth 500ms cross-fade animations.